From 61a06da05adb6878e46bc1a484d58b18a81043fe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 19:23:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 24/65] Port Add Character to Party, Load_CharacterRecord and
 the party list

Port H013+$52E0 Add_CharacterToParty (trampoline $0518) with the party
rules (duplicates, 6 player characters or 8 members, paladins, rangers,
evil alignments), H066+$03D0/$03DE (list the saved .WHO characters),
$0852 (open without the disk substitution), $1B0E Load_CharacterRecord
(record, .swg items, .fx effects) and $27EE (append to the party),
H063+$0D80 (party list in the main menu) and $1D44 (timed message).

Host dos.library: locks now keep the host path, and Examine/ExNext scan
directories (dirent, or _findfirst on Windows).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013G8KST8dgGfenpqx3RukYi
